// GitHub: https://github.com/calvin-quint/docs/blob/main/01-detection-engineering/kql/endpoint/antivirus_detections.kql
// Defender Antivirus Detections
// MITRE ATT&CK: Execution — technique varies by payload (generic AV signature feed)
// Detects: Raw feed of Microsoft Defender Antivirus detection events from
//          DeviceEvents. Used as a base lookup/enrichment source for other
//          rules and manual triage rather than a standalone alert — pair
//          with the specific malware family/behavior to map an exact technique.
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType == "AntivirusDetection"
